<title>UK: IBCA rates L-Bank 2001 notes AAA l-term.</title>
<headline>IBCA rates L-Bank 2001 notes AAA l-term.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>IBCA, the European credit rating agency, said on Monday it had assigned a long-term AAA rating to the 10 billion peseta issue of 7.375 percent notes due 2001 by Landeskreditbank Baden-Wuerttemberg (L-Bank).</p>
<p>IBCA said the rating was based on the implied federal German guarantee for the obligations of L-Bank.</p>
<p>-- International Bonds Unit +44 171 542 8682</p>
</text>
